    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/1700829dc0978b79c4af23b484778d03.avif?t=1752659916\" width=500 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You have arrived at a forgotten tower full of dangers, and there is no way to escape. Your only chance is to reach the top of the tower and break the curse using the power of runic artifacts. Help Maia and other explorers uncover the secrets of the cursed tower!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shadowed Rune is a challenging action roguelike that you can play solo or in two-player co-op*. Combine the power of runes to discover new spells and ascend the tower to break the curse. You'll face enemies that are not as friendly as they seem, puzzles where you\u2019ll need to wisely use the power of the elements. Have I mentioned the bosses guarding each floor? They are just the beginning... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Local cooperative multiplayer requires at least one connected controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique roguelike adventure with elements of bullet hell action, puzzles, and challenging bosses.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/b9039279f371b4333919db08cd01403e.avif?t=1752659916\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative mode. Every new adventure can be played in co-op mode for two players, even online (via Steam Remote Play Together).<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/fdbff5ba7aed5c81ff3ab1e0ab63123d.avif?t=1752659916\" width=445 height=273 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic system based on seven elements (water, fire, wind, earth, lightning, light, and darkness) that will allow you to generate 134.217.728 possible spell combinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/8cfedd289de20ef671d1a73522820976.avif?t=1752659916\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also have a complete magical compendium that will allow you to discover powerful spells in the middle of combat. Switch between runes and change your attacks in real time to modify your strategy without stopping the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower divided into seven floors with dozens of levels to explore. Moreover, every adventure is different: Levels will change after each defeat. Are you ready to break the curse? Try again! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment, solve puzzles, fight waves of enemies, and discover unique artifacts that will change the way you play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor so you can create your own challenges and share them with your friends to play solo or in co-op. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/55aae7d714e0d71c5592e4527e3a56af.avif?t=1752659916\" data-has-big width=800 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Demo available in October 2025.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access release in Q4 2025.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/d82737a3ec1adf72ba0d14f8a7cb6657.avif?t=1752659916\" width=386 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Early Access version will include at least:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 3 playable characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon with at least 3 floors and dozens of levels to conquer. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, the game will be updated periodically, taking community feedback into account.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translation to Spanish and English at a minimum.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content to be implemented during development after the Early Access launch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story expansion with new chapters and more endgame content. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemies and final bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New spells to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More items, artifacts, and characters to interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics to be announced. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translation to more languages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What will happen once the game exits Early Access and is officially released?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is very special, and our intention is to support it post-launch with periodic free content expansions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to add 'The Shadowed Rune' to your wishlist.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/1700829dc0978b79c4af23b484778d03.avif?t=1752659916\" width=500 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You have arrived at a forgotten tower full of dangers, and there is no way to escape. Your only chance is to reach the top of the tower and break the curse using the power of runic artifacts. Help Maia and other explorers uncover the secrets of the cursed tower!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shadowed Rune is a challenging action roguelike that you can play solo or in two-player co-op*. Combine the power of runes to discover new spells and ascend the tower to break the curse. You'll face enemies that are not as friendly as they seem, puzzles where you\u2019ll need to wisely use the power of the elements. Have I mentioned the bosses guarding each floor? They are just the beginning... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Local cooperative multiplayer requires at least one connected controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique roguelike adventure with elements of bullet hell action, puzzles, and challenging bosses.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/b9039279f371b4333919db08cd01403e.avif?t=1752659916\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative mode. Every new adventure can be played in co-op mode for two players, even online (via Steam Remote Play Together).<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/fdbff5ba7aed5c81ff3ab1e0ab63123d.avif?t=1752659916\" width=445 height=273 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic system based on seven elements (water, fire, wind, earth, lightning, light, and darkness) that will allow you to generate 134.217.728 possible spell combinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/8cfedd289de20ef671d1a73522820976.avif?t=1752659916\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also have a complete magical compendium that will allow you to discover powerful spells in the middle of combat. Switch between runes and change your attacks in real time to modify your strategy without stopping the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower divided into seven floors with dozens of levels to explore. Moreover, every adventure is different: Levels will change after each defeat. Are you ready to break the curse? Try again! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment, solve puzzles, fight waves of enemies, and discover unique artifacts that will change the way you play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor so you can create your own challenges and share them with your friends to play solo or in co-op. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/55aae7d714e0d71c5592e4527e3a56af.avif?t=1752659916\" data-has-big width=800 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Demo available in October 2025.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access release in Q4 2025.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/d82737a3ec1adf72ba0d14f8a7cb6657.avif?t=1752659916\" width=386 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Early Access version will include at least:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 3 playable characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon with at least 3 floors and dozens of levels to conquer. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, the game will be updated periodically, taking community feedback into account.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translation to Spanish and English at a minimum.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content to be implemented during development after the Early Access launch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story expansion with new chapters and more endgame content. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemies and final bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New spells to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More items, artifacts, and characters to interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics to be announced. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translation to more languages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What will happen once the game exits Early Access and is officially released?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is very special, and our intention is to support it post-launch with periodic free content expansions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to add 'The Shadowed Rune' to your wishlist.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
